# Milestone progress tracker

When implementing Room milestones:

1. Read `docs/21-milestone-progress.md` for current Status / active focus before starting work.
2. Prefer the earliest incomplete milestone’s open acceptance items (see also `docs/20-roadmap-testing.md`).
3. After landing work (code + tests), update `docs/21-milestone-progress.md` in the same change:
   - Flip completed checklist items `[ ]` → `[x]`.
   - Adjust the §0 dashboard Status / Approx % / Active focus.
   - Prepend a short dated line under **Log**.
4. Only set a milestone Status to `done` when **all** of its Acceptance boxes are `[x]` and CI evidence exists — never from chat summary alone.
5. Do not invent parallel progress docs; this file is the single living checklist.
